{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04082","headline":"奉和圣制至长春宫登楼望稼穑之作 · 苏頲","name":"奉和圣制至长春宫登楼望稼穑之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝迹奚其远，皇符之所崇。\n敬时尧务作，尽力禹称功。\n赫赫惟元后，经营自左冯。\n变芜秔稻实，流恶水泉通。\n国阜犹前豹，人疲讵昔熊。\n黄图巡沃野，清吹入离宫。\n是阅京坻富，仍观都邑雄。\n凭轩一何绮，积溜写晴空。\n礼节家安外，和平俗在中。\n见龙垂渭北，辞雁指河东。\n睿思方居镐，宸游若饮丰。\n宁夸子云从，秪爲猎扶风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04082.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04082","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}